      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open the menu",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Enemy near me</strong> sets how far the Inbox's Near you list reaches. Tap <strong>≡</strong>, scroll the tools to <strong>OpenDefence Main</strong> and, under <strong>Enemy near me</strong>, tap <strong>10 km</strong> or <strong>Own…</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/13a27028db9237a5.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick a distance",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the field, type a distance from 1 to 50 and tap <strong>OK</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/457c792b862da68d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check the distance",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The third button under <strong>Enemy near me</strong> now reads <strong>3 km</strong>. Tap <strong>✕</strong> to close the pane.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6e853dfab4009a14.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check the Inbox",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Inbox</strong> and scroll down. The <strong>Artillery</strong> 1.9 km away now shows under <strong>Near you, 3 km</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/cc86b0f68d82fd39.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
